// IV General principles). Default rule set: common law plus the majority modern rule; the Model Penal Code is labelled and
// used only where the stem says so. No state-specific law is taught. Every fact pattern is original; the research drafts in
// research/crim.md were rewritten with new facts and none of NCBE's sample fact patterns is reused.
// MPC section content is paraphrased from knowledge (the ALI text is paywalled), so it is status "general", never quoted.
//
