            answer: 1,
            facts: ["for an hour only", "intended from the start to keep the car"],
            say: "Fraud gets her possession, not title, so the crime is larceny by trick, not false pretenses.",
            hook: "The keys were consent; the lie behind them was not.",
            status: "general", src: "Common-law larceny by trick; crim.md §4.1",
