            stem: "The jurisdiction defines crimes as at common law. A man confronted a store owner in the store's parking lot and said that he would burn down the store next Friday unless the owner handed over $5,000 right now. The frightened owner took $5,000 from his pocket and handed it over. The man was charged with robbery.",
