            stem: "A statute in the jurisdiction defines robbery as a theft in which the defendant uses force, or threatens immediate force, against a person in taking the property or in keeping it or escaping immediately afterward. On a crowded train platform, a man slipped a wallet out of a commuter's coat pocket without her noticing. A moment later she felt the empty pocket, saw the wallet in his hand, and grabbed his arm. He shoved her to the ground, breaking her wrist, and ran off with the wallet.",
