            stem: "The jurisdiction defines crimes as at common law. A man parked his car in his neighbor's driveway and refused to move it when the neighbor asked. When the neighbor stepped toward the car, the man raised a tire iron over his head, stood within arm's reach of the neighbor, and said that if the neighbor took one more step toward the car he would split his skull. The terrified neighbor stopped and called the police. The man never swung the tire iron.",
