            stem: "The jurisdiction defines burglary as at common law. A man owned a small house that he rented to a tenant, who lived there. Knowing that the tenant had just bought an expensive television, the man returned at midnight while the tenant was asleep, opened a closed but unlocked back window, and climbed in, intending to take the television and sell it for himself. The tenant woke up, and the man fled empty-handed.",
