            stem: "The jurisdiction defines crimes as at common law. A woman asked her cousin to help her rob a jewelry store where she had once worked, and the cousin genuinely agreed. They chose a date the following week. Before either of them did anything else, the cousin told the plan to a friend, who called the police, and both women were arrested. The woman was charged with solicitation, conspiracy and attempted robbery.",
