            stem: "The jurisdiction has adopted the Model Penal Code's definition of conspiracy and requires an overt act in furtherance of the agreement. A man offered an acquaintance $3,000 to help him break into a pharmacy at night and steal painkillers, and the acquaintance said yes. The acquaintance was a police informant who never intended to take part. The next day the man bought bolt cutters for the break-in, and he was arrested as he left the store. He was charged with conspiracy to commit burglary.",
