            stem: "The jurisdiction defines crimes as at common law. A woman whose driver's license had been suspended was at home when her elderly neighbor collapsed in her yard, unable to breathe after a bee sting. She called emergency services and was told that the nearest ambulance was forty minutes away. No one else was nearby. She put the neighbor in her car and drove him five miles to a hospital, where doctors saved his life. She was charged with driving with a suspended license and asked for a jury instruction on necessity.",
